msgid "Chess Clock"
msgstr "Horologio de chacos"

#: data/eu.fortysixandtwo.chessclock.desktop.in:9
msgid "chess;game;clock;timer;"
msgstr "chacos;joco;horologio;temporisator;"

#: data/eu.fortysixandtwo.chessclock.metainfo.xml.in:7
msgid "Time games of over-the-board chess"
msgstr "Tempore de partitas de chacos sur tabuliero"

#: data/eu.fortysixandtwo.chessclock.metainfo.xml.in:9
msgid ""
"Chess Clock is a simple application to provide time control for over-the-"
"board chess games. Intended for mobile use, players select the time control "
"settings desired for their game, then the black player taps their clock to "
"start white's timer. After each player's turn, they tap the clock to start "
"their opponent's, until the game is finished or one of the clocks reaches "
"zero."
msgstr ""
"Horologio de chacos es un application simple que forni controlo de tempore "
"pro jocos de chacos sur tabuliero. Intendite pro usage in dispositivos "
"mobile, le jocatores selectiona le configurationes de controlo de tempore "
"desirate pro lor partita, alora le jocator de nigre tocca su horologio pro "
"initiar le temporisator del jocator de blanc. Post le torno de cata jocator, "
"illes tocca le horologio pro initiar le horologio de su opponente, usque le "
"partita es finite o un del horologios attinge le zero."

#: data/eu.fortysixandtwo.chessclock.metainfo.xml.in:18
msgid ""
"The main screen, showing timers for the white and black players of a chess "
"game"
msgstr ""
"Le schermo principal, monstrante le temporisatores pro le jocatores blanc e "
"nigre de un joco de chacos"

#: data/eu.fortysixandtwo.chessclock.metainfo.xml.in:22
msgid "The time control selection screen"
msgstr "Le schermo de selection de controlo de tempore"

#: data/eu.fortysixandtwo.chessclock.metainfo.xml.in:26
msgid ""
"The main screen in a portrait aspect ratio, showing one timer rotated 180 "
"degrees"
msgstr ""
"Le schermo principal in ration de aspecto vertical, monstrante un "
"temporisator rotate in 180 grados"

